 to stop it. \nAre sisters really forever? Or will middle school change things for good?","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/twins.mp3","author":"Varian Johnson, Shannon Wright","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/9Jcfd2vj0xuaP9Pp2tEPgBrWLw7w---LppuHfKyT02g.mp3","abridged":false,"accent":"US English","copyright":"Text © 2020 by Varian Johnson. Additional text © 2021 by Varian Johnson. Audio ℗ 2021 by Scholastic Inc. All rights reserved.","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/rBGEmn4ghrW4Ze1c0XouuceowO0Cuy8x9EH9qzI5smQ"},"languages":["en"],"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2023-10-12T12:22:26.246Z"},"accents":["US English"],"authors":["Varian Johnson","Shannon Wright"],"copyrights":["Text © 2020 by Varian Johnson. Additional text © 2021 by Varian Johnson. Audio ℗ 2021 by Scholastic Inc. All rights reserved."],"genres":["funny-stories"],"narrators":["Ahnya O'Riordan","Grace Capeless","Mashari Bain","Malcolm Bowen","Antoinette Comer","André Blake","Armand Xavier Rufen-Blanchette"]}}}